OL,3,GNEWSAFamily says man killed in train
OL,4,Acrash was 'centre of their world'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who was killed when the van he
OL,7,Fwas driving was hit by a train on a
OL,8,Fcrossing have said he was "the centre
OL,9,Fof their world".
OL,11,FSimon Gettings, 55, was killed when the
OL,12,Fsupermarket delivery van he was driving
OL,13,Fwas hit by a Northern train in
OL,14,FBurscough, Lancashire, on Saturday at
OL,15,Fabout 15:00 BST.
OL,17,FThe family of the Southport married
OL,18,Ffather-of-two said he had retired as a
OL,19,Fteacher after 25 years "so he could
OL,20,Fspend more time" with them.
